(
    title: "Phantom Tank",
    description: Some("Phantom tanks come down on your energy base and you meet them in an armored car — first among the walls of the streets, then across a river, then out on the open prairie. Shooting one scores 100 points; ramming one scores 200 but wrecks your car with it, and clearing all twenty in a battle earns you a spare. Let a single phantom tank reach the base and it is over."),
